      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Memorize Doabs and their bounding rivers: Bist Doab (Beas and Sutlej) and Bari Doab (Beas and Ravi).",
        "Remember Harike Wetland is located at the confluence of the Beas and Sutlej rivers and is a designated Ramsar site.",
        "Distinguish between physiographic zones: the Shivalik foothill region (Kandi) versus the central Alluvial Plains."
